es?\n\nCan you hit a man-sized target at 300y with a rifle? Or at 30y with a pistol?\n\nDo you have applicable combat skills? Leadership? Medical? Comms? Nav? Are they up to date?\n\nDo you have proper equipment? Night vision / thermal? Drones? PPE?\n\nDo you have sustainment covered for yourself and your family? Water? Food? Power? Medical supplies?\n\nWhen was the last time you slept outside?\n\nWhen was the last time you dug a foxhole?\n\nWhen was the last time you dragged another human being 50 yards?\n\nWhen was the last time you self-applied a TQ?\n\nI'm not trying to poop in anyone's Lucky Charms; just saying there's no time like peace time to prepare.", "author": "areyoupregnant", "created": 1789816292054, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "vote_for_MAGA_2020", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Thanks to MrTeezyForSheezy for broaching the subject. Let's stop bloviating and actually do the work IRL.", "last_comment_created": 1789821134668, "content": "<p>MrTeezyForSheezy</p>\n<p>Open question to everyone -- are you prepared to fight ?</p>\n<p>Can you run 2 miles?</p>\n<p>Can you hit a man-sized target at 300y with a rifle? Or at 30y with a pistol?</p>\n<p>Do you have applicable combat skills? Leadership? Medical? Comms? Nav? Are they up to date?</p>\n<p>Do you have proper equipment? Night vision / thermal? Drones? PPE?</p>\n<p>Do you have sustainment covered for yourself and your family? Water? Food? Power? Medical supplies?</p>\n<p>When was the last time you slept outside?</p>\n<p>When was the last time you dug a foxhole?</p>\n<p>When was the last time you dragged another human being 50 yards?</p>\n<p>When was the last time you self-applied a TQ?</p>\n<p>I'm not tryi